Este repositório contém um currículo em LaTeX com build reproduzível.
Os arquivos principais são resume-br.tex e resume-en.tex.
Os PDFs finais são gerados em build/resume-br.pdf e build/resume-en.pdf.

Arquivos principais

resume-br.tex / resume-en.tex       guardam o conteúdo e o layout.
build.sh                            script automatizado para compilar os PDFs em lote.
Containerfile                       define a imagem com XeLaTeX e fontes Cormorant Garamond.
compose.yaml                        executa o build completo dentro do container.
.github/workflows/publish-image.yml publica a imagem no GHCR.
.github/workflows/build.yml         compila os PDFs e cria release em push de tag.
.gitignore                          ignora artefatos do LaTeX, a pasta build e o phone.tex.
phone.tex                           (não versionado) telefone para os builds locais.

Build local

./build.sh

O telefone fica fora do repositório público.  Para incluí-lo num build
local, crie o phone.tex com uma linha:

\renewcommand{\phone}{ $\cdot$ +55 (00) 00000-0000}

Sem esse arquivo, os PDFs saem sem o telefone, como os publicados pela
integração contínua.

Build com container

podman-compose run --rm resume-pdf

--- English

This repository contains a LaTeX resume with reproducible builds.
The main source files are resume-br.tex and resume-en.tex.
The final PDFs are generated at build/resume-br.pdf and build/resume-en.pdf.

Main files

resume-br.tex / resume-en.tex       stores content and layout.
build.sh                            automated script to batch compile the PDFs.
Containerfile                       defines the XeLaTeX image and Cormorant Garamond fonts.
compose.yaml                        runs the full build flow inside the container.
.github/workflows/publish-image.yml publishes the image to GHCR.
.github/workflows/build.yml         compiles the PDFs and creates a release on tag push.
.gitignore                          ignores LaTeX artifacts, the build directory and phone.tex.
phone.tex                           (untracked) phone number for local builds.

Local build

./build.sh

The phone number stays out of the public repository.  To include it in
a local build, create phone.tex with one line:

\renewcommand{\phone}{ $\cdot$ +55 (00) 00000-0000}

Without that file the PDFs have no phone number, like the ones the CI
publishes.

Container build

podman-compose run --rm resume-pdf
